*
*  Run an optimization of the PM7 parameters for intermolecular interactions
*  
*
*     Keywords used
*
* SET:        Define a file that contains a list of compounds to be used.
* REF:        Define one or more folders that contain reference data for systems defined by SET.
* CYCLES:     Run 50 cycles and then stop.  
*
set="Intermolecular interactions in water dimer set.txt" ref="../../reference data/Data Intermolecular interactions/Water dimers all" cycles=50
*
*
FN11        H
FN21        H
FN31        H
FN11        O
FN21        O
FN31        O
ALPB_O      H
XFAC_O      H  0 2
PAR7 1 3
PAR8 -1 0
PAR9 -1 0
*
* Terminate the list of parameters to be optimized.
*
end

